### 1. log in
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "luka@example.com",
  "password": "secret"
}

### 2. use the token (works)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "url": "https://example.com/session-1",
  "title": "Posted with an active session"
}

### 3. log out (204)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. use the same token again (401: session expired)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "url": "https://example.com/session-2",
  "title": "Should fail after logout"
}

### 5. log out without a token (401)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/logout